  "origin": "Chat-template-ready Danish prefix-continuation instruction pairs derived from the Danish Dynaword corpus. Text from Dynaword source files (adl, ai-aktindsigt) was split so the model continues a given prefix; rows were judged accepted/rejected with google/gemma-4-31B-it. Contains only judge-accepted rows: 105,317 rows from 110,396 audited. Form: synthetic + audited. Contributed 252M sampled tokens per epoch to the DFM Mimir v1 corpus.",
